menu "PlantHub radio role"

choice PLANTHUB_DEFAULT_RADIO_ROLE
    prompt "Default radio role (when NVS radio_role is unset)"
    default PLANTHUB_RADIO_ROLE_WIFI_ONLY
    help
        One universal image, one radio per node chosen at runtime. Both the
        BLE and Zigbee stacks are compiled in; this selects which one STARTS
        on a hub whose NVS has no radio_role yet. wifi_only is the shipped
        default: a fresh hub brings up WiFi and the web UI, and the
        onboarding step asks the user to pick BLE or Zigbee (a reboot
        applies it). The other two exist for bench builds.

config PLANTHUB_RADIO_ROLE_WIFI_ONLY
    bool "wifi_only (neither BLE nor Zigbee)"
config PLANTHUB_RADIO_ROLE_BLE
    bool "ble"
config PLANTHUB_RADIO_ROLE_ZIGBEE
    bool "zigbee"
endchoice

endmenu
